  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 812ae90ae60a547618d7c14f414408a1, type: 3}
    text: Vibey.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eeee74257d5f74aefb2d16df4877b4b2, type: 3}
    text: Viiibes.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f1965ef7804334c4296085e9308ac7d6, type: 3}
    text: That's the Altar of Peace. Isn't it wonderful when things are lit?
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8f67c3d6320644848eacc39d0867af6, type: 3}
    text: 'That''s the Altar of Peace. Maybe it would be awesome to give it a little
      light. '
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 63e56191acad44a2b88e959991d97fb0, type: 3}
    text: 'Want to just hang around here? '
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d5e81e1c4a6a445eaa17e85203574118, type: 3}
    text: Let's hang out here.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: da37f13c121cf4b529e8759ffc8f7f69, type: 3}
    text: This is pretty nice here.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea31e891c1fd548c7ba7ffeba3331ce9, type: 3}
    text: Beautiful place to just chill.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a45ece0caee5448afae6e302f77a086e, type: 3}
    text: Beautiful place to just chill.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7c4f8a4d81c34027ab46559d1eb7920, type: 3}
    text: Wow, so gorgeous here!
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d0a7ff397167c4cb9b5cb2146e4610fb, type: 3}
    text: Do you want to just hang around here?
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 33701a1d76db14d838759c921f0ce2b3, type: 3}
    text: That's the Forest of Love. How lovely is it to see it alive?
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 47d33a17ccbe842dd899b1f207b2f05f, type: 3}
    text: That's the Forest of Love. I think it needs a little light!
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ffd82a011cfc254f81b96afb93c48ae, type: 3}
    text: I see a lanter we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 61c804cf5bc8d4e1e9fbd43cb558f8ef, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2654c929483e4d443b528d578d381776, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b497efebdbbc8423fb3ca86758ae7f80, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6c2cdee677d034e4fb8e509076f1449d, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86e0793090cb742489e8bb5e133f0bc3, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 927d3443a65432a4f81bec7b8847b138, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 62ddff1be06cd4fa88d9614ec0acaaa5, type: 3}
    text: I see a lantern we can light up over there.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bfb5e7c99979142b59d084291aed0be5, type: 3}
    text: That's the Lighthouse of Truth. It's so beautiful when it's lit.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbf351f5c06ac42859a835ed29407112, type: 3}
    text: That's the Lighthouse of Truth. Would be cool to light it up.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49e8240646a71454ea2ca15c6e4e36c5, type: 3}
    text: Over here, I am near a lantern.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0d4eb82db32294609bfe61ff0c71354b, type: 3}
    text: Over here! I am near a lantern.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 12b70765549c1435190d4761d2100196, type: 3}
    text: Over here! I am near a lantern.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3a38c2784b5b442780dd01d1def8319, type: 3}
    text: Over here! I am near a lantern.
