    text: Over here! I am near a seed.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b4d679d3589514871ab6719291e69321, type: 3}
    text: None of us can ever fathom or grasp, how much we are loved.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf828820973474c52a95f3dbb91b1b69, type: 3}
    text: What a blessing it is to be alive.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4702483efe7ec41cf90412b3317bf2a2, type: 3}
    text: It's wonderful that you're around.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1fb77b8662b404e56bc806a4aa11b667, type: 3}
    text: It's such a privilege that I can help you. I delight in it.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85bd76e57a028482cbf85e110cf98f16, type: 3}
    text: Whenever we delight in helping others, love delights in us.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3080d36804aef4ef8bed50c2348500b3, type: 3}
    text: When we delight in love, love delights in us.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9214b7ae2deaa45c0988cc9337759a88, type: 3}
    text: 'Grateful to be breathing, let us give back that breath to love. '
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ee0c99e0e3e664270b78e795c6290d98, type: 3}
    text: Isn't this world so beautiful?
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a9c821a6c0184828be2b02808e2bac3, type: 3}
    text: Huh.
