  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38abd53d675734faba01121c625a8b53, type: 3}
    text: Intro Parable 01
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: debe23ae1e9ee4802a031fa06f0fc570, type: 3}
    text: Intro Parable 02
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd35603a0e4aa42a9a1d612cd86953ab, type: 3}
    text: Intro Parable 03
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 286a0e608315a433793c67be71e54c49, type: 3}
    text: Intro Parable 03 01
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e55956003b8ff4568ae8a7077ed0cf7f, type: 3}
    text: Intro Parable 04
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 26540183694e64715b69ae5b5d0baec7, type: 3}
    text: Intro Wind Director 01
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 51fe130a92391d141855c979addc0526, type: 3}
    text: You are not forgotten. Even the smallest sparrow is seen, and you are worth
      far more.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72756e5d9f0ee42fea8adb4544a3b481, type: 3}
    text: "You are always loved, and Love is always with you \u2014 not for what
      you do, but for who you are."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3cfc1c1f218a4c4d898029d6409c31b, type: 3}
    text: "The greatest love is sacrifice \u2014  in kindness and in dedication of
      your life \u2014 for a friend or for a stranger."
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1ed0ad15812d479e8fda2f5c4833a42, type: 3}
    text: You are light. Not because you shine on your own, but because Love burns
      in you like a flame.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5b11b0673aab4e6ab376880d9c14a2a, type: 3}
    text: Forgiveness is not a weakness. It is the key that unlocks your own heart.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a116a161f52374a929802ac6122d32da, type: 3}
    text: Blessed are the gentle ones, for they will inherit this world.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7001e9a4118f5cc47a43cb528758e140, type: 3}
    text: This parable is a poem to love.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7047db5681ecebb4ea4ba3dcf44620aa, type: 3}
    text: Even the darkness will not be dark to you; the night will shine like the
      day, for darkness is as light to you.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2735a556c92d144178bbe657d851ab6d, type: 3}
    text: Don't be overcome by darkness. Rather, overcome darkness with Love!
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e56ffe2e4ead449b99334de11e64a589, type: 3}
    text: All things can be done with Love. Love always strengthens.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c589ee328bac19248bef979599160930, type: 3}
    text: Love is patient. Love is kind. It does not boast, it does not envy. It
      is not proud.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4082eae61f624478f9d052fc5283acaf, type: 3}
    text: We have not been given a spirit of darkness. But of power, of love and
      a sound mind.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed1bba0d82f104cdda90b1647d648cba, type: 3}
    text: Love your neighbor, as you love yourself.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7043253f0dd9d4d64859c04dd0fe0144, type: 3}
    text: Guard your heart, for everything you do flows from it.
  categoryEntries: []
